*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD file for E210 Bluetooth Thermal Printer
*% Copyright (C) 2026 E210 Thermal Printer Linux Project

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "E210.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(E210 Thermal Printer)"
*ModelName: "E210 Thermal Printer"
*ShortNickName: "E210"
*NickName: "E210 Thermal Printer (CUPS)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% CUPS raster filter
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertoe210"
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsVersion: 2.4

*% Resolution
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Media Types
*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Continuous
*MediaType Continuous/Continuous Paper: "<</MediaType(Continuous)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gap/Die-cut Label (Gap): "<</MediaType(Gap)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType BlackMark/Black Mark Label: "<</MediaType(BlackMark)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% Print Density / Darkness (Calibrated 5-10 practical range)
*OpenUI *Darkness/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 6
*Darkness 4/Draft Light (4): ""
*Darkness 5/Normal Light (5): ""
*Darkness 6/Normal (6 - Default): ""
*Darkness 7/Medium (7): ""
*Darkness 8/Dark (8): ""
*Darkness 9/Very Dark (9): ""
*Darkness 10/Maximum (10): ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*% Dithering
*OpenUI *Dither/Dithering Method: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *Dither
*DefaultDither: FloydSteinberg
*Dither FloydSteinberg/Floyd-Steinberg Error Diffusion: ""
*Dither Threshold/Fixed Threshold (Text/Line Art): ""
*CloseUI: *Dither

*% Page Sizes
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Continuous50mm
*PageSize Continuous50mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "<</PageSize[142 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 227]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 198]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label50x30mm/50 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113 170]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label40x30mm/40 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label30x20mm/30 x 20 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85 57]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CableWrap/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "<</PageSize[108 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Continuous50mm
*PageRegion Continuous50mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "<</PageSize[142 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 227]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 198]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label50x30mm/50 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[142 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113 170]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label40x30mm/40 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label30x20mm/30 x 20 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85 57]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CableWrap/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "<</PageSize[108 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Imageable Area (left bottom right top)
*DefaultImageableArea: Continuous50mm
*ImageableArea Continuous50mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "3 0 139 283"
*ImageableArea Label50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "3 0 139 227"
*ImageableArea Label50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "3 0 139 198"
*ImageableArea Label50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "3 0 139 142"
*ImageableArea Label50x30mm/50 x 30 mm Label: "3 0 139 85"
*ImageableArea Label40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "3 0 110 170"
*ImageableArea Label40x30mm/40 x 30 mm Label: "3 0 110 85"
*ImageableArea Label30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "3 0 82 85"
*ImageableArea Label30x20mm/30 x 20 mm Label: "3 0 82 57"
*ImageableArea CableWrap/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "3 0 105 71"

*% Physical paper dimensions
*DefaultPaperDimension: Continuous50mm
*PaperDimension Continuous50mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "142 283"
*PaperDimension Label50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "142 227"
*PaperDimension Label50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "142 198"
*PaperDimension Label50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "142 142"
*PaperDimension Label50x30mm/50 x 30 mm Label: "142 85"
*PaperDimension Label40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "113 170"
*PaperDimension Label40x30mm/40 x 30 mm Label: "113 85"
*PaperDimension Label30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "85 85"
*PaperDimension Label30x20mm/30 x 20 mm Label: "85 57"
*PaperDimension CableWrap/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "108 71"

*% Custom Page Size Support
*VariablePaperSize: True
*LeadingEdge Short: ""
*DefaultLeadingEdge: Short
*MaxMediaWidth: "142"
*MaxMediaHeight: "2834"
*HWMargins: 3 0 3 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 57 142
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 28 2834
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% End of PPD
